# =========================================================================
# Ancient Japanese Goods Definitions (混載貨物・Piece Goods catg=1)
# - millet: Produced by Dryfield / Millet Farm (雑穀畑)
# - sake: Produced by Ancient Sake Brewery (酒造工房) from rice
# - raw_stone: Produced by Open Stone Quarry (露天採石場)
# - stone_goods: Produced by Stone & Jade Workshop (石器・玉作工房)
# - raw_meat: Produced by Hunting Ground / Livestock Farm (狩猟場・畜産場)
# - cured_meat: Produced by Meat Curing Workshop (肉加工所) from raw_meat + salt
# - iron_sand: Produced by Iron Sand Pit (砂鉄採取場, 540+)
# - crude_iron: Produced by Tatara Furnace (たたら製鉄場, 540+)
# - ironware: Produced by Blacksmith Workshop (鍛冶工房, 540+)
# =========================================================================
obj=good
